# Domain scope (always)

- One session → one package (`packages/<one>` or `extensions/agent-k`). See root `AGENTS.md`.
- Start with a Feature ID (e.g. AGENT-010, CHAT-002). Prefer Feature ID migration over file copy.
- Cross boundary → change `packages/shared` types/protocol first.
- Do not publish npm libs unless reuse across apps is explicit.
- Enforce R-001…R-005: Composer≠ModelRouter, Typed Work Events, Worktree transactions, Plan state machine, Tool contracts.
- No cycles. Dependency direction: extension → host → chat-ui/core → tools|providers|plan|worktree|safety ← shared.
